# The ownframe example, scripted (galaxy_s24, 1080x2340):
#   cargo run --example ownframe --features script -- --morph-script examples/scripts/ownframe.morph
# Frames 0..2 are presented and frame 3 is skipped by not acquiring, so the
# capture after it is byte for byte the one before it: whatever was
# presented last stayed on screen.
frames 3
screenshot presented
frames 1
screenshot after_a_skip
# The next step of the colour, three presented frames on.
frames 3
screenshot stepped
# A backgrounding, and the app picks up against the new target: the frame
# it presents first must be drawn, since a fresh surface has no previous
# frame to keep.
suspend
resume
frames 1
screenshot after_a_resume
